WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:05.660
There.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.430
<i>I end up losing track of time 
when I train alone at night.</i>

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.950
<i>Somebody's there.</i>

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.280
<i>Could it be... a ma—?!</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.500
Stop right there!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.140
This is...

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.100
Well, well.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:54.030
Don't tell me I have to 
straighten this up, too.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.200
That's all for today.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:30.080
<b>Effort and Giftedness</b>

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.160
For the afternoon, you'll practice 
team versus team combat.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:30.960
Combat practice?

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.340
Team leaders will choose the opposing teams.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:34.430
That is all.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.500
Combat practice, huh?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.140
It always comes so abruptly.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.690
Sensei must decide it on a whim.

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:48.460
Even so, it ties in with our ongoing 
evaluations, so we must try to win.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.900
Hey, Tsubaki, could you go 
up against my team again?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:57.120
Fine by me. Against Team Rat, 
we always learn something.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.120
Fight my team, Tsubaki.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:01.290
Benisumomo... Tachiaoi and I were just...

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.410
Would you let us have them?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.360
Huh?

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.170
Sure.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:07.880
Tachiaoi!

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.290
Then it's decided.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:12.060
Looking forward to it, Tsubaki.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.110
<i>You</i> invited us first. I'm sorry.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.230
It's cool.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.910
Benisumomo's strong, and you're about 
the only one who can match her.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.710
You and I will spar next time.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.350
Benisumomo can be pushy.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.360
What about your team, Mokuren? 
Want to pair up?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.310
Sure.

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:35.030
Okay, I'll check with Hagi 
and Higuruma, too.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:35.770
Okay!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.620
We're going to fight Team Sheep?

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:41.820
Hey, Beni-senpai! You could 
have at least checked with us!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:46.430
Does it matter? 
We'll win lickety-split, then take it easy.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.330
That works.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.110
What's with that rationale?!

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:52.380
You always decide on your own.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:52.380
It isn't too late. 
Let's pick another team, Nee-sama.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.700
What for?

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:56.380
There are parts where willpower 
and effort are enough,

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.250
I mean, Touwata is too stuck on willpower 
and hard work to know when to quit.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.750
but our devised plan varies 
based on which team we face,

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.800
Mizubashou is so good at 
setting traps, it's a pain.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.800
so there are preparations to make!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.550
Then there's Benisumomo.

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.910
She's super tough.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.220
Well, I'm gifted.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:12.690
That doesn't mean it's okay to 
just lie around all the time!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.770
Effort first, then effort second!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:16.960
Third, fourth, and fifth 
are likewise effort!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.410
And after that, it's willpower, willpower—

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.150
I can't take all this hot-bloodedness.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:25.930
Why not save that stuff for when 
you've gotten stronger than me?

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.110
Ugh, what a jerk.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.650
Mizu-senpai, chime in anytime!

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:34.400
Oh, sorry. I wasn't listening.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.120
Well, see you this afternoon.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.550
Wait, Beni-senpai!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.720
<b>Sheep</b>

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.720
About our strategy this time.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.180
<b>A</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.180
<b>B</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.180
<b>C</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.180
<b>D</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.180
<b>E</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.180
I will lure the enemy using hard work! 
And guide them here using willpower!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.300
Mizu-senpai, put traps here.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.020
Okay.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.950
And here, Beni-senpai will—

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:54.950
Got it!

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.480
Hey, where are you going?!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.860
It boils down to the usual plan, right?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.870
I'll go take a nap until Team Dog shows up.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:08.330
And I'm concerned about the traps 
I set, so I'll go check on them.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.450
Huh?!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.030
See ya.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.360
Now, what should we do for a plan?

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.340
The last time we faced Team Sheep,

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:25.880
Asagao fell for a food trap, 
and we lost when she got taken hostage.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.550
Let me out!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.110
You weakest link.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:29.800
Huh?!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:33.710
Before that, we lost because 
Benisumomo tricked you!

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.500
I couldn't help that!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.200
I can't help it with food, either!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.880
Those are two different things!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.820
Then <i>food</i> is a different thing, too!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.360
That isn't what I meant!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.360
<i>Food</i> isn't what I...

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.140
Touwata!

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:47.710
She's here already!

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.500
You've got guts, waltzing in here alone!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.240
No, wait! You've got it wrong!

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.700
I came to ask Tsubaki-san for a favor!

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.790
A-A favor?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.620
Well...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:02.800
Tsubaki-san! Could you fight 
one-on-one with Beni-senpai?!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.710
Huh?

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.970
Please give her a real thrashing!

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:08.130
Huh?!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.720
You're the only one who can 
win against Beni-senpai!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:12.940
Please!

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.930
Well, um...

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.350
Just calm down, and explain.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:23.860
Well, you see... Beni-senpai has talent,

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.880
yet she puts all her focus 
on that instead of effort.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:31.510
Just earlier, she went off somewhere, 
talking about a nap.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:37.610
I just know there'll be trouble if she 
never learns the importance of hard work.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:39.210
S-So...

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.420
I'm worried about her.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.050
All right.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.150
I'll do it.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:49.840
R-Really?! Thank—

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.300
What gives?!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.780
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.720
Let me go, already!

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.600
Your tricks won't work on us.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.560
No! I would never!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.040
That's right! Touwata never meant to—

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.730
Either way.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.750
Now, our team is sure to win.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:10.740
That's right.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:14.700
<i>They never got over being taken hostage.</i>

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.950
Now, we'll use her to 
make them admit defeat...

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.290
...then go take it easy!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.960
Hey, you two!

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:23.880
Ow!

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:26.240
What the heck?!

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.340
Help!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.020
Asagao, you're heavy!

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:31.910
Says you, but I can't move!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:32.870
Oh?

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:37.680
Sorry, that's one I set purely out of habit.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.270
Time to break a habit, then!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.360
Tsubaki-chan, help!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:47.020
Nee-sama, get me out!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.940
Well, I'll go fight Benisumomo.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.360
Nee-sama!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.660
Tsubaki-chan!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.910
Mizubashou, be a dear 
and let those two down.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:56.950
Sure.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.240
Willpower, Tsubaki-san!

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.690
Oh. It's you, Tsubaki.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.820
I had a feeling you'd be here, Benisumomo.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:35.030
How did you know that?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.740
Because we've known each other a long time.

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.140
Huh...

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.140
Touwata asked me to fight you.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.380
Your teammates still don't know, do they?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:50.090
That you're an incredibly hard worker.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.000
Never tell them, either!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.050
You and Sensei are the only ones who know.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:57.710
If this got out, it'd hurt my reputation.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.760
I don't think that's true.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:03.600
It's awesome that you work so hard.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.500
Stop that! It's embarrassing!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:08.860
Now, then.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:12.080
Shall we dance? It's been a while.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:15.820
It has, since we went one-on-one!

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:06.310
That's...

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:10.100
Wonder if she's okay.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.890
Of course she is, dumb Asagao!

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.090
Beni-senpai!

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:31.270
Touwata was worried about whether 
you'd be all right from now on.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.430
I see.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:36.010
I had better train more, then.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.150
You should just reveal your secret.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.460
Don't wanna.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.660
Beni-senpai!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.580
Are you okay, Nee-sama?!

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:46.790
Which of you won?

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.170
It's a draw.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:54.750
I haven't seen you like this 
in a while, Benisumomo.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.520
Are you injured?

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:57.510
I'm fine.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.770
Nee-sama!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.460
Want me to call the medical team?

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:02.180
No, I'm fine.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:11.600
I, uh... never thought you'd 
tie with Tsubaki-san.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.190
I do think that's amazing.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:18.160
But if you'd worked hard, you might have won.

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.810
Next time I'll win.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:27.620
I-If you don't put forth any effort, 
you'll never win a match you can't win now!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.080
I can win.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.540
After all,

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:37.050
I'm a genius.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.970
T-Team Dog! And you, Beni-senpai!

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.970
Someday, I'll beat you using my hard work!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.220
You'll learn how important it is!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:52.480
Yes, yes. I look forward to it.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.150
That makes it official! 
Don't you go regretting it later!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.730
Okay, bye now.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.910
You'll see how important hard work is!

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:00.610
Yes, yes.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.620
I don't know if they've 
got it together or not.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.140
Weird team.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.190
But thank goodness you're okay, Nee-sama!

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:09.280
I'm kind of wiped out!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.540
Then why don't we stay here and take it easy?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.700
Agreed!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.800
Nee-sama, today for a change they 
didn't skimp on the side dishes!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:26.340
<b>Dining Hall</b>

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:24.220
<b>Escape Plan With Nee-sama</b>

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.340
Fish is nice, but I wanted 
some other meat, too.

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:29.630
You ate plenty. You could 
even stand to cut back.

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.070
But then I'd die!

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.860
Don't you agree, Nee-sama?!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.570
Sazanka, next to your mouth, there's—

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:40.570
Oh, shut up!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:45.570
<i>I've heard that men eat 
a lot, but is that true?</i>

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:50.430
<i>Oh, no! Lately my mind's 
been on men too much!</i>

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:52.330
<i>I need to stay focused.</i>

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:53.330
Nee-sama!

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:57.080
Yes? What is it, Sazanka?

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:58.870
Tsubaki.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:04.170
I heard today's lesson switched 
from Scroll 1 to Scroll 2.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.480
Is that so?

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.770
You'll go get yours, right? 
Let's go together.

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:08.510
Okay.

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:09.810
Uh...!

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:14.060
See you this afternoon. Work hard in class.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.950
You've got some rice on your face.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:19.300
I know!

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.530
Why are you angry?!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.830
I didn't eat any meat, so I'm already hungry!

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:34.550
Hey, Asagao.

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.250
Huh?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.000
Wanna sneak out of class?

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.600
We can't do that.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.400
I want to see Nee-sama.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.590
She hasn't paid any attention to me today!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.680
But isn't it in the rules?

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.260
Something like, it's wrong 
to sneak out of class.

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:53.240
Blame that on Nee-sama's class 
being in a different hut!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.450
And it's so far away!

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:55.480
Oh, my.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:00.860
Don't you think she's 
been ignoring us lately?

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.780
She spaces out now and then.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:08.760
Earlier, I put that rice grain on 
my face so she'd get it for me,

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.300
and she didn't even notice.

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.830
Oh, so that was on purpose.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:13.790
That's right.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:17.580
Anyway, I want to go see her.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.670
I think Tsubaki-chan will 
get mad if you sneak out.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.670
Don't be dim, Asagao.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.550
Nee-sama...

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:29.930
Sazanka!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.320
Nee-sama!

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.940
You braved danger just to come see me.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:39.440
Such a bad girl...

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.540
That's how it's sure to go!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.400
I wonder.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:47.400
You two are so annoying, 
like screeching monkeys.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:50.990
How about we switch team names, after all?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.780
Morning, Housenka!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:56.910
<b>Bathroom</b>

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.240
<i>You're</i> the monkey.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.340
Which is fitting, given your team name.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:01.120
Besides, showing off after coming out of 
the bathroom makes you look like an idiot.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:06.090
I've had diarrhea since yesterday. 
I can't help it.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:07.710
Again...

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.690
All right, be seated.

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.700
Sensei's here.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.550
It's time to start class.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.270
I'll go pee now.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.730
Make it quick, okay?

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.670
Huh? Sazanka!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:27.860
Sensei! Asagao can't do 
her business by herself,

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.550
so I'm helping!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.820
Huh?

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.820
She needs "help"!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.160
I can do it by myself, you know!

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.050
Don't come out until I come back.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.410
Or I'll get found out.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.240
Huh?! This doesn't work for me!

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.710
I'll give you some dried sweet potato later.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.310
Sweet potato?

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.370
Don't let me down.

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.050
Sweet potato...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.600
Hey, Asagao! Hurry up in there!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.750
It might take a little longer.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.220
Why?! Are you doing more than peeing?!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.470
Not exactly...

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.440
And why can't you manage by yourself?!

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:04.810
You're pretty huge, for a baby!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.390
Oh, wow.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:07.830
"Baby," she said.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.570
So embarrassing.

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.980
Hey! How long will it take?!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.010
Oh.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.840
This one's like Nee-sama.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.540
Stuck on Nee-sama.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:33.940
You must be me.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:41.680
<b>Potatoes</b>

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:41.680
<b>Asagao</b>

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.680
It's always this way! It's Sazanka's fault!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.020
<b>Don't use these,
Asagao.
—Sazanka</b>

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.020
I haven't even done anything wrong!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.360
<b>Don't use these,
Asagao.
—Sazanka</b>

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.360
But I'm the one they always get mad at!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:51.810
I can't stand you, Sazanka!

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:03.200
Whatever! I'll do it!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.750
I get to see Nee-sama! 
I get to see Nee-sama!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.550
Sazanka!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.470
Hold it!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.260
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.890
I told you not to come out until I got back!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.070
I couldn't stay in there! 
They were all laughing!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:21.890
Besides!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.890
I was told I get no dinner 
if I don't catch you!

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:29.210
Oh, you are so useless!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:32.670
This way!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.740
Asagao's serious!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.280
Dinner!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.660
Stop!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.870
No!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.870
Sazanka and Asagao.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.380
They should be in class. 
What're they doing?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.870
Dinner!

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.090
Asagao!

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.590
If you let me go, I'll give you more than 
enough dried sweet potato for dinner!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.510
It's a good deal for you.

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:02.720
Let me think it over.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.520
Hey, you two!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.600
Check it out! We caught a huge boar!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:12.100
It'll be fresh pork for supper!

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:22.880
What's the matter?

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:27.500
Oh, well... I just felt uneasy.

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:30.500
Here's hoping nothing bad happens.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.460
Tsubaki, you're pretty 
good at those predictions.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.750
Maybe there's a man nearby.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:37.170
Huh?

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.110
Just kidding.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:40.050
There wouldn't be.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.250
<i>A m-man...</i>

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.240
<i>No, stop. Don't dwell on it.</i>

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:51.560
<i>And this morning, that's how I missed 
out on what Sazanka was talking about.</i>

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:55.540
<i>This afternoon, I'll be sure 
to listen to what she...</i>

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.930
It's your fault, Sazanka.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:09.080
You break that "don't sneak 
out of class" thingy.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:13.740
Plus, we're getting boar meat tonight. 
I'm not about to miss out on that.

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:14.950
Then, how about this?!

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:18.960
You can't tempt me! 
Because tonight's pork night.

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:20.670
I'll give you my entire meat portion!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.500
If this works, it'll mean double the meat.

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.510
<i>Double the meat!</i>

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.430
If you insist.

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.200
Just for a little while.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.390
<i>She's so simple.</i>

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:39.490
Number 1: You will not do whatever 
you want without permission.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:42.910
Have you forgotten the Akane Class rules?

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.540
Nee-sama!

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:55.210
U-Um, Sensei told me to go bring her back.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.680
Oh, right!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:20:00.480
That "don't do whatever you want" 
rule you were talking about!

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:04.450
I told Sazanka about that, too, 
but she doesn't listen one bit!

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.320
I heard that whole part 
about her tempting you.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.120
Run away!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.890
You snuck out of class, too, Tsubaki-chan!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.560
I got permission.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.950
Why did you go and sneak out?

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:29.870
I mean...

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:39.260
The weather's nice, 
so I wanted to take a walk.

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:49.750
See that it doesn't happen again.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.610
Sazanka, why did you lie?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:01.820
Well...

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:07.780
I figured I wouldn't be able to hold back, 
and I'd tell her everything on my mind.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:12.650
And I didn't want Nee-sama 
to think it was her fault.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:16.470
I don't really get it.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.590
<i>That was not a convincing lie.</i>

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:27.060
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:31.040
<i>This afternoon, I'll give 
you my undivided attention.</i>

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:35.260
<i>Mm, smells nice.</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:11.350
Double the meat...

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:15.400
Sazanka, you'll really give me all of it?

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:17.890
Technically, it <i>was</i> a promise.

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:20.600
Sazanka...

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:24.590
Then, Sazanka and I will go halfsies.

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:25.720
Halfsies?

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:26.160
Yes.

00:23:26.160 --> 00:23:28.180
So, I can eat all this?!

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:28.880
Feel free.

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:32.340
Then, then, Nee-sama, 
I want you to feed some to me!

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:34.810
If you insist. Just for today.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:37.010
The fatty part's melting 
right on top of my tongue!

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:35.850
Okay!

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:38.910
To be continued!
